      "en": "Pappaus & verestys techniques, minimizing stress in C&R, classic Lohikeitto salmon soup, butter-fried perch, and traditional wood-smoking.",
      "zh": "芬兰法定人道处死（敲击击晕与割鳃放血）、路亚钓获放流黄金守则、正宗芬兰三文鱼莳萝浓汤（Lohikeitto）与黄油香煎脆皮五道黑。",
